          {
            "type": "text",
            "title": "Beyond whole numbers",
            "body": "a⁰ = 1, a⁻ⁿ = 1/aⁿ and a^(1/n) is the n-th root. So 2⁻³ = 1/8 (not −8), and 16^(3/4) = (⁴√16)³ = 8."
          },
